<p>Condensate hot steam around your foes in radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 3, 4,</acronym> burning them for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">184, 248, 298, 340, 377</acronym> fire damage and applying the wet effect for 4 turns, halving their stun resistances.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Mindpower.</p>